# This repo is developed on Windows and deployed to Linux. A CRLF that sneaks
# into a deploy file breaks it quietly: `Procfile` becomes `web: ...\r` and the
# process name is wrong; `requirements.txt` asks pip for a file literally named
# `...\r`. Force LF on everything text, and especially on the files the build
# reads.
* text=auto eol=lf

Procfile        text eol=lf
*.txt           text eol=lf
*.py            text eol=lf
*.toml          text eol=lf
*.json          text eol=lf
*.sh            text eol=lf

# Leave the frontend build output and binaries alone.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary
